title: "pyrsb3: B3 public files as Arrow (Python bindings of the rsb3 Rust crate)"
type: software
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23784907
repository-code: "https://github.com/milkway/pyrsb3"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/pyrsb3/"
authors:
  - family-names: Leite
    given-names: André
    email: leite@castlab.org
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4718-9766"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
keywords:
  - B3
  - Bovespa
  - COTAHIST
  - finance
  - Arrow
  - Python
  - Rust
abstract: >-
  pyrsb3 is the Python binding of rsb3, a Rust crate that downloads, validates
  and converts the public files of B3, the Brazilian stock exchange, into
  Arrow. The COTAHIST parser reads the official 245-byte fixed-width historical
  quotes file strictly, keeps prices as integer cents and hands the result to
  Python as a pyarrow.Table through the Arrow C Data Interface.
